      ],
      "source": "https://www.warrenhistorytrail.org/blairstown/",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s historic district, listed on the State and National Register of Historic Places, contains 177 preserved structures.",
