      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Blairstown%2C_New_Jersey",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 28.45‑mile Lackawanna Cut‑Off, rebuilt for New Jersey Transit, is expected to resume passenger service in 2026 or 2027.",
